{"story":{"id":"event-grand-archive-2005","title":{"zh":"虚空虫","en":"Voidworms"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":"art/1d63676aac33381abc58.webp","start":"grand_archive.2005","chapters":3,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们发现，这些远距离信号源于一种简单的太空生物，我们将其命名为“虚空虫”。似乎整个星系都充满了这种生物。根据信号的不同波长，我们确定这些生物在达到最终成熟之前会经历多个生长阶段。虽然它们表面上看起来并不具有攻击性，但它们的交流模式表明它们在星系范围内进行着协调。","en":"We have discovered that the far-reaching signals originate from a simple spaceborne organism we have taken to calling \"Voidworms\". It appears that the galaxy is riddled with these creatures. From the varying wavelengths of the signals, we have determined that "},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"grand_archive.2005","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"special_projects:VOIDWORMS_PROJECT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"story.101.bb","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/grand_archive_events.txt:369"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"grand_archive.2015","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/04_projects_grand_archive.txt:17"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"grand_archive.2005","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"虚空虫","en":"Voidworms"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们发现，这些远距离信号源于一种简单的太空生物，我们将其命名为“虚空虫”。似乎整个星系都充满了这种生物。根据信号的不同波长，我们确定这些生物在达到最终成熟之前会经历多个生长阶段。虽然它们表面上看起来并不具有攻击性，但它们的交流模式表明它们在星系范围内进行着协调。","en":"We have discovered that the far-reaching signals originate from a simple spaceborne organism we have taken to calling \"Voidworms\". It appears that the galaxy is riddled with these creatures. From the varying wavelengths of the signals, we have determined that the creatures develop through several stages of growth before reaching final maturity. Though they do not appear outwardly aggressive, their patterns of communication indicate coordination on a galactic scale."},{"zh":"","en":""},{"zh":"这些寄生生物天生无法繁殖，必须依赖从星球上的宿主获取养分。为了让“虚空虫”产生三头虫成长必不可少的激素，它们必须从有人居住的星球上获取足够的有机物质。作为雌雄同体的生物，它们选择伴侣主要取决于互补的物理特征和相似的体型。","en":"These parasitic creatures lack the natural ability to reproduce and must rely on the acquisition of planet-borne hosts. Sufficient organic matter must be harvested from inhabited planets for the \"Voidworms\" to produce a crucial hormone within their mating trios, known as \"troikas\". As hermaphroditic creatures, the selection of partners is determined primarily by complementary physical traits and comparable size."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1d63676aac33381abc58.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"story.101.aa","label":{"zh":"区区猎物。","en":"Easy prey."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"每摧毁一支虚空虫舰队+$@voidworms_hunting_buff_food_reward|0$£food£","en":"+$@voidworms_hunting_buff_food_reward|0$ £food£ for every Voidworm fleet destroyed"}],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"区区猎物。","en":"Easy prey."},"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"label":{"zh":"待宰的无脑野兽。","en":"Mindless beasts to be culled."},"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]}]},{"key":"story.101.bb","label":{"zh":"真是奇妙的生物。","en":"Fascinating creatures."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:VOIDWORMS_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/grand_archive_events.txt:369","story":"event-grand-archive-2005"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false}]]}],"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"condition","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"condition","group":"c15694","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","sc